# Joyride, the funk / city pop demo (tools/demos/joyride.py), opens and
# plays. Every engine it shows off is where the Demo Songs page says, and
# the SCAL on the last choruses moves the song to D (the HyperSynth chords
# follow the key); the intro puts it back in C.
wait 1500
expect_view song
expect_screen_text Joyride
expect_project_param scaleKey 0
expect_project_param tempo 112
expect_instrument_param 0 engine drum
expect_instrument_param 5 engine fm4
expect_instrument_param 6 engine hyper
expect_instrument_param 7 engine fm4
expect_instrument_param 8 engine wav
expect_instrument_param 9 engine phys
expect_instrument_sample 10 brass-trumpet.wav
expect_instrument_sample 11 textures-riser.wav
# The first chorus (row 04): drums, bass, pad, keys, lead and horns
press d 80
press d 80
press d 80
press d 80
wait 100
reset_audio_stats
press s 80
wait 2500
expect_audio_activity 1000
expect_screen_text PLAY:SONG
press s 80
wait 400
# The last choruses (row 0C): the key goes up to D
press d 80
press d 80
press d 80
press d 80
press d 80
press d 80
press d 80
press d 80
wait 100
press s 80
wait 1200
expect_project_param scaleKey 2
expect_audio_activity 1000
press s 80
wait 400
# From the top: the intro sets C again
press u 80
press u 80
press u 80
press u 80
press u 80
press u 80
press u 80
press u 80
press u 80
press u 80
press u 80
press u 80
wait 100
press s 80
wait 800
expect_project_param scaleKey 0
press s 80
wait 400
expect_no_error
quit
